# Storage directory (user data)
storage/
# Anchored: an unanchored `coverage/` matches at ANY depth, and it silently swallowed
# docs/modules/domain/analysis/coverage/MODULE.md — an authored doc, untracked for as long as the
# module has been named that. Test output lands at the repo root, so the anchor loses nothing.
/coverage/
